    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/dfaf08d7a1a6f024febe86c7ebdd41af.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>You're a go-kart. And you've got one goal: to be the last one on the map. To get there, all roads are good! Take on your friends in this frenetic party-game, dodging attacks with your kart and flying enemies off the track with bonus items thanks to its over-the-top physics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c332fb0afb74808b4d7da4a42dedcea2.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c332fb0afb74808b4d7da4a42dedcea2.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c332fb0afb74808b4d7da4a42dedcea2.mp4?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/ccfb7945b8dd0aea3d0a8f99788b52ad.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>As the game progresses, the map will become increasingly unstable! Use the holes to push your opponents into them, but be careful not to fall in!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c1d9918b396900a53dbf94b5cee3cdfb.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c1d9918b396900a53dbf94b5cee3cdfb.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c1d9918b396900a53dbf94b5cee3cdfb.mp4?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/e5c606871b14d6c05115201ab44e0e8b.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>All the elements of the game have physical rules. Master their particularities and victory will be yours!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/cdb79d6495ef97ea9413d9cd9b909d11.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/cdb79d6495ef97ea9413d9cd9b909d11.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/cdb79d6495ef97ea9413d9cd9b909d11.mp4?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/7582abeee5ecf8618abc572c2a4932e8.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>Each map has unique interactive elements that will influence the game! Try to master and take advantage of them!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c9e9938be36fc1528eadc3d918bc8483.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c9e9938be36fc1528eadc3d918bc8483.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c9e9938be36fc1528eadc3d918bc8483.mp4?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/dfaf08d7a1a6f024febe86c7ebdd41af.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>You're a go-kart. And you've got one goal: to be the last one on the map. To get there, all roads are good! Take on your friends in this frenetic party-game, dodging attacks with your kart and flying enemies off the track with bonus items thanks to its over-the-top physics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c332fb0afb74808b4d7da4a42dedcea2.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c332fb0afb74808b4d7da4a42dedcea2.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c332fb0afb74808b4d7da4a42dedcea2.mp4?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/ccfb7945b8dd0aea3d0a8f99788b52ad.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>As the game progresses, the map will become increasingly unstable! Use the holes to push your opponents into them, but be careful not to fall in!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c1d9918b396900a53dbf94b5cee3cdfb.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c1d9918b396900a53dbf94b5cee3cdfb.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c1d9918b396900a53dbf94b5cee3cdfb.mp4?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/e5c606871b14d6c05115201ab44e0e8b.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>All the elements of the game have physical rules. Master their particularities and victory will be yours!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/cdb79d6495ef97ea9413d9cd9b909d11.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/cdb79d6495ef97ea9413d9cd9b909d11.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/cdb79d6495ef97ea9413d9cd9b909d11.mp4?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/7582abeee5ecf8618abc572c2a4932e8.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=64 /></span><br>Each map has unique interactive elements that will influence the game! Try to master and take advantage of them!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c9e9938be36fc1528eadc3d918bc8483.poster.avif?t=1749932575\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c9e9938be36fc1528eadc3d918bc8483.webm?t=1749932575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861480/extras/c9e9938be36fc1528ea